## 2026-11-18 — 733d6b8 — include igp/cookies.py

Fix: `scripts/dl_wm_scrapers/igp/cookies.py` was missing from 42d71bb. The
vault's own `.gitignore` ignores `cookies*` at any depth, which swallowed the
cookie *loader* (a 63-line module, no cookie data). Without it `igp/profile_history.py`
fails to import, so a fresh clone of the scraper set would not run.

Now tracked explicitly (`git add -f`). The `.gitignore` rule itself is unchanged
(the file is not ours to edit); the real cookie files are still excluded.

Checked: `git ls-tree -r --name-only HEAD | grep igp/cookies` lists it, and
`python -c "import igp.profile_history"` succeeds from a clean checkout of the
script directory.

