## 2026-11-18 — 42d71bb — add dl_wm scraper set

Added the scripts that produced the vault's data, pinned as a copy of the public
`roadshowpractice/dl_wm` (same layout, so relative imports work unchanged).

    scripts/dl_wm_scrapers/
      README.md
      bin/collabnet.py          queue driver: scrape, resume, one graph at the end
      bin/ig_collab_graph.py    account/co-post graph (png, html, edges.tsv, nodes.tsv)
      bin/ig_word_sort.py       word sorts from captured captions
      igp/__init__.py
      igp/capture.py            single-post capture -> post model
      igp/cookies.py            Netscape cookie loader
      igp/download.py           media download
      igp/extract.py            post/caption extraction
      igp/profile_history.py    Playwright timeline scraper (resumable)
      igp/select.py             post selection
      lib/drive_check.py        output-drive writability check (uuid probe)

Why: the vault is meant to carry the small text files *and* the scripts, not just
their output — a scrape can then be re-run from what the vault records.

Checked:
- `python -m py_compile bin/*.py lib/*.py igp/*.py` — OK
- `python -c "import igp.profile_history, igp.cookies, igp.extract"` — OK
  (in the `dl_wm` env: playwright 1.65.2, Chromium 159.0.8154.6)
- `git ls-tree -r --name-only 42d71bb | grep -iE 'cookie|credential|wallet|token'`
  — no cookie/credential files; `igp/cookies.py` is the loader, not a cookie

Not included, on purpose: any cookie file or credentials, and any queue/input
data (that lives under `inputs/`, untracked).

