## 2026-11-18 — aca124a — initial layout

`git init` plus the empty shape of the vault, mirroring John's `boner_vault`:

    .gitignore          ignores working media under dl_wm_outputs/
                        (mp4/mov/jpg/png/heic), plus cookies, credentials and
                        wallet files at any depth
    README.md           what the vault is, why, layout, disk-check rule
    archive/.gitkeep        finished work, one folder per batch
    dl_wm_outputs/.gitkeep  working area for new downloads and scrapes
    metadata_backup/.gitkeep  copies of JSON/TSV metadata

Why: raw captures stay separate from finished work, so a scrape can be re-run or
dropped without touching the archive; git tracks the small text and ignores the
heavy media.

Checked: `git log --oneline`, `git status` clean, `sha256sum README.md .gitignore`
recorded for the job.

